  "nonGoals": [
    "Require generated Verilog-AMS, UVM or UVM-MS for ordinary Nodal simulation.",
    "Translate arbitrary Scala bytecode or host object graphs into portable verification IR.",
    "Claim complete open-source Verilog-AMS support from Verilog-A parsing or partitioned co-simulation.",
    "Make one simulator callback order, random engine, waveform format or command language part of Nodal semantics.",
    "Silently omit unsupported verification intent.",
    "Build a native analog solver merely to avoid external simulators in the initial release.",
    "Make UVM inherit from Verilog-TB.",
    "Use one common target-implementation class for Verilog-TB and UVM.",
    "Emulate UVM methodology in procedural Verilog to preserve a universal capability claim.",
    "Require every common VIP to support every generated profile."
  ],
